Cock</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiktor</surname><given-names>SZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Laga</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Greenberg</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Increase in condom use and decline in HIV and sexually transmitted diseases among female sex workers in Abidjan, Cote d'Ivoire, 1991&#x02013;1998</article-title><source>AIDS</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>251</fpage><lpage>258</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11807310</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00002030-200201250-00015</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walden</surname><given-names>VM</given-names></name><name><surname>Mwangulube</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Makhumula-Nkhoma</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Measuring the impact of a behaviour change intervention for commercial sex workers and their potential clients in Malawi</article-title><source>Health Educ Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>545</fpage><lpage>554</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10557524</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/her/14.4.545</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ngugi</surname><given-names>EN</given-names></name><name><surname>Plummer</surname><given-names>FA</given-names></name><name><surname>Simonsen</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevention of transmission of human immunodefiency virus in Africa: effectiveness of condom promotion and health education among prostitutes</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1988</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>887</fpage><lpage>890</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2902326</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(88)92480-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Alary</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mukenge-Tshibaka</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernier</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Geraldo</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Lowndes</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Meda</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gnintoungbe</surname><given-names>CAB</given-names></name><name><surname>Anagonou</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Joly</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Decline in the prevalence of HIV and sexually transmitted diseases among female sex workers in Cotonou, Benin, 1993&#x02013;1999</article-title><source>AIDS</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>463</fpage><lpage>470</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11834959</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00002030-200202150-00019</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kaul</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimani</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagelkerke</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Fonck</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ngugi</surname><given-names>EN</given-names></name><name><surname>Keli</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>MacDonald</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name><name><surname>Maclean</surname><given-names>IW</given-names></name><name><surname>Bwayo</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Temmerman</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ronald</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Moses</surname><